From 02e0a198795d2e28b84dd76c7b039684547c3e6d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:26:54 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 04/26] pinctrl: mstar: add MStar/SigmaStar pin controllers

Add the common MStar pinctrl code and the msc313, PM and ssd210
pin controller drivers.

Taken from the final state of the linux-chenxing mstar_v6_7_rebase branch
(https://github.com/linux-chenxing/linux, Daniel Palmer et al.) and ported
to v7.3. Updated for the 7.3 pinctrl core (struct group_desc
now wraps struct pingroup, function_desc is const) and explicit
platform_device.h includes.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
